--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,760] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 17 | Text: 当你不能再给别人带来任何价值的那一刻
Segment #2   [00:00:02,760 --> 00:00:03,800] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 6  | Text: 你就要清醒地知道
Segment #3   [00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:05,680] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不会再有任何的朋友
Segment #4   [00:00:05,680 --> 00:00:08,020] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 亲人 爱人 什么都没有了
Segment #5   [00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:09,980] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 你要说以前你重情重义也好
Segment #6   [00:00:09,980 --> 00:00:10,640] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 说什么也罢
Segment #7   [00:00:10,640 --> 00:00:12,500] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 你要说你以前我帮了谁谁谁
Segment #8   [00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,060] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #9   [00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,740] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 8  | Text: 现在想也不要想这回事
Segment #10  [00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,020] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 9  | Text: 现在的你和当初有能力
Segment #11  [00:00:17,020 --> 00:00:18,680] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 10 | Text: 有价值去帮助别人的你
Segment #12  [00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,720] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 7  | Text: 他已经不是同意你了
Segment #13  [00:00:19,720 --> 00:00:20,780] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 如果你没有价值
Segment #14  [00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:22,680] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 11 | Text: 那讲良心的人最多可能说一句
Segment #15  [00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,640] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 你是个好人
Segment #16  [00:00:23,640 --> 00:00:24,580] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 3  | Text: 你人很好
Segment #17  [00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,980] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 12 | Text: 但如果说你现在还想着以前的情意
Segment #18  [00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:27,760] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 4  | Text: 以前的付出
Segment #19  [00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,440] | Elapsed:  15.38s | Words: 2  | Text: 那不好意思
Segment #20  [00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,740] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 你帮过谁谁就是你的仇人
Segment #21  [00:00:30,740 --> 00:00:32,060] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 我们春风得意的时候
Segment #22  [00:00:32,060 --> 00:00:32,860] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 身边都是朋友
Segment #23  [00:00:32,860 --> 00:00:34,220] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 感受的可能都是善意
Segment #24  [00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:34,860] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 都是温情
Segment #25  [00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:36,200] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 这是成功的喜悦
Segment #26  [00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,180] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 人一旦失去价值的时候
Segment #27  [00:00:38,180 --> 00:00:39,940] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 这个世界上没有任何的朋友的
Segment #28  [00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,640] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 3  | Text: 我就告诉你们
Segment #29  [00:00:40,640 --> 00:00:42,100] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 5  | Text: 人在顺庆的时候
Segment #30  [00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,500] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 建立的感情太脆弱了
Segment #31  [00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:45,100] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 如果说你们现在身在低谷
Segment #32  [00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,440] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 我也给你们分享一句话
Segment #33  [00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:48,940] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 失败同时它也是淡实的
Segment #34  [00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:50,340] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 我们会有好起来的这一天
Segment #35  [00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:51,380] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 4  | Text: 但是我们要明白
Segment #36  [00:00:51,380 --> 00:00:53,400] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 这一条路我们只能去走了
Segment #37  [00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:54,600] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 运载这条路上
Segment #38  [00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,020] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 不会再有任何人相伴
Segment #39  [00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:58,040] | Elapsed:  34.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 只能去自己咬着牙关扛回去
Segment #40  [00:00:58,040 --> 00:00:59,320] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 金蝉托托也罢
Segment #41  [00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,400] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 破脸成蝶也好
Segment #42  [00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:00,880] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 2  | Text: 冲出去
Segment #43  [00:01:00,880 --> 00:01:01,580] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 什么都不要想
Segment #44  [00:01:01,580 --> 00:01:02,600] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 5  | Text: 什么也不要留恋
Segment #45  [00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:04,040] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 只有再次站起来
Segment #46  [00:01:04,040 --> 00:01:05,080] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 7  | Text: 你才能重新上桌
Segment #47  [00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,480] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 9  | Text: 那这又说上载桌不重要
Segment #48  [00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,760] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 4  | Text: 甚至你有可能
Segment #49  [00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,860] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 你都可以自己可以做
Segment #50  [00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:09,580] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 3  | Text: 加油母亲
Segment #51  [00:01:09,580 --> 00:01:11,160] | Elapsed:  46.28s | Words: 6  | Text: 就你们越来越好
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
